{
  "version": 1,
  "verified_on": "2026-10-17",
  "scope": "Nominal board power rails only; no GPIO limits, load currents or external-part ratings.",
  "matching": "Exact KiCad library and part identity, then exported pin names. Pin numbers are never mapped to physical board positions.",
  "notes": [
    "Nominal rail voltages describe the design, not a measurement or proof of power.",
    "Nano pinout and power-tree description identify the 3.3V rail; the datasheet connector table has a contradictory 5V USB description for +3V3. The 5V USB wording is not used."
